  "implemented": [
    "Strict encoded-plan parser and source fingerprint; deterministic full original source-bundle export and trust reconstruction.",
    "Bounded complete archive with original Full/Patch input, committed baseline, candidate, plan, planning rules, old/new delivery projections, trust, signed source bundle and historical check window.",
    "Same-owner authenticated incremental Begin/Chunk/Seal workflow advancing only on actual AppliedResult, current source/time checks, fresh base/RBAC read before recording, final safe-read durable receipt.",
    "Atomic prepared-content and principal/idempotency-key indexes; concurrent logical retry resolves to first stored record.",
    "New bounded command and explicitly versioned nonempty snapshot; historical validation is distinct from current-rule requalification.",
    "Actual three-voter GenerationStore compaction and InstalledGeneration installation, closed/reopened recovery, exact original prepared record and durable tail replay."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No desired revision advance, Ready state, runtime apply receipt, configuration operation, or enabled public planning endpoint is produced.",
    "Real runtime observation provider, durable source watermarks and current retained resource registry head remain pending.",
    "Ordinary commit/apply, full-target runtime and effective-file receipts, operation recovery, rollback and watch remain pending.",
